  "body": "## Changelog\n* 1825a8d762f3742277df4bf3ddd40efa5384d328 MARSOHS-2740: use DigitalOcean Inference for --model on claude-code and codex (#2118)\n* 115b093a8ec31217314798e7a3648c7264cf0e6e MARSOHS-2743: show the session ID in harness-runtime show and list (#2116)\n* 383243048e9e6a210673aa0e93438cbefc37a298 harness-runtime update: document live skills updates (MARSOHS-3133) (#2152)\n* 12db7b82ff0f3558e755efec714b2e7430fc0888 agents: say an OAuth switch needs a connection you own (MARSOHS-3145) (#2155)\n* a063bb8271acd7b904e914f7dd2bfe656f72d78b Payment method PopUp (#2149)\n* adc7b653c72834b696d6f8a1157b584352d0246c fix(MARSOHS-2746): explain limited availability when workspaces are not enabled (#2132)\n* c0a65121823b0e61ecf4f26c5d534cc07255efd8 MARSOHS-2581: show progress while a paused session wakes (#2113)\n* 9da0fb16f51bf0cc115cc4170064be902c07046e MARSOHS-2587: print logs as JSON with -o json, add --pretty (#2110)\n* 221521a124878f99d1f93d5bcc5eb569ae83f66c MARSOHS-2590: fix swapped retry-wait help and --interactive default text (#2109)\n* d799331f4c08d81c860c3dae4b850ef6cf9733f0 harness-runtime update: document switching a session's OAuth connection (MARSOHS-3106) (#2150)\n\n"
